WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.860
This is Media.

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:05.560
Our own shows, like the Vegans Explore Podcast,

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:09.440
bring you years of conversations with the people building this movement.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:14.340
Next to them are the podcasts, documentaries and books the community votes

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.000
to the top.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:18.920
Press Play and listen right on the page while you keep looking around.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:23.000
Documentaries show where to watch them, and books link to their own pages.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.880
We want to hear from you.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:27.420
As a member, you shape what rises here:

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.220
vote for the shows, films and books you love,

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:34.420
save episodes to My Saves, let us know if something needs to be fixed,

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.600
and if you host a podcast, apply to join our network.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.560
Membership is free.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:43.200
We ask for a short survey so we know real people are joining,

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:45.740
and that keeps this community worth your time.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:47.380
Bring people with you:

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:51.820
invite your friends, your community, new Vegans and Pre-Vegans.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:55.360
And you earn points for everybody who joins using your link.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:01:00.360
That is the easiest way to grow your experience and open new doors in our

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:00.880
community.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.720
Press Play on something good today.

